Open Context Protocol (OCP) Reference Implementation
Copyright 2026 Rajesh Banoth

This product includes software developed as part of the Open Context Protocol
project (https://github.com/Rajesh1213/OCP).

This project implements a profile of the Model Context Protocol designed by
Anthropic. The Model Context Protocol specification is published at
https://modelcontextprotocol.io and is referenced openly; this project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.

